```

Notes: three trials: (2.1, 200, -0.3), (2.1, 210, -0.3) and (2.2, 200, 0). In E1 c4 in phase with c2 added x and left turn, so the opposite sign is expected to cut the turn.

Result of H2 (E2): anti-phase c4 at -0.3 cut x to 0.149 (lag 200) and 0.133 (lag 210). 2.2 Hz lag 200 with c4 off gave x 0.275, y 0.070, heading -19.3. Verdict rejected.

